### Create a new Tenant/Organization
POST http://localhost:3001/api/v1/tenants/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner_user_id": 1,
  "academy_name": "Nike Design Academy",
  "academy_slug": "nike-design"
}

###

### Update Tenant Branding
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/v1/tenants/1/branding
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "logo_url": "https://example.com/logo.png",
  "banner_url": "https://example.com/banner.png"
}

###

### Update Tenant Domain
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/v1/tenants/1/domain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "custom_domain": "learn.nikedesign.com",
  "ssl_enabled": true
}

###

### Get Tenant Analytics
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/tenants/1/analytics
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Recruited Teachers for Tenant
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/tenants/1/teachers
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Tenant Revenue Payouts
GET http://localhost:3001/api/v1/payments/payouts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update User Payment Details (UPI) for Tenant Owner or Teacher
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/v1/users/1/payment-details
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "upi_id": "owner@upi",
  "razorpay_account_id": "acc_razorpay_123"
}
